use: (1) It's free - no additional chips at risk, (2) I get to see showdown, (3) My opponent's checking pattern suggests they might also have a weak hand or missed draw, and (4) There's a small chance I could win with Q-high if they completely missed. Raising would be a pure bluff that's unlikely to work against someone who showed initial strength pre-flop, and folding when I can check for free makes no sense.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
